    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the Indo-Pacific Endeavour 2023 (IPE23), Australia delivered more than 7 tonnes of pre-positioned humanitarian supplies to Laos on a Royal Australian Airforce C-130 aircraft. The supplies support the Lao government to strengthen its preparedness and response capacity for natural disasters or humanitarian emergencies. The supplies included items that meet basic needs of people such as kitchen kits, hygiene kits, blankets, bed nets and mats. Having these essential relief supplies pre-positioned in the country will enable timely deployment in the event of a disaster.</narrative>
    </description>
